{"title":"Children Of The Rune","synopsis":"Dari Studio yang membawakan kalian SSSClass Suicide Hunter\nOh nak pastikan dirimu selamat\nSetelah pamannya menyebabkan kejatuhan keluarganya satusatunya hal yang dimiliki oleh Boris adalah pedang milik keluarganya Winterer Tapi siapa yang menyangka kalau harta ini akan menjadi penyebab bencana lainnya\nSetiap kali orang menargetkan Winterer hati Boris menjadi lebih dingin dan suram seperti musim dingin itu sendiri\nPertualangan Boris pun dimulai demi bertahan hidup dan melindungi pedang keluarganya\nApa yang akan menunggunya di akhir pertualangan ini Rahasia macam apa yang dimiliki oleh Winterer sang pedang musim dingin","alternative_title":"룬의 아이들","author":"JEON Minhee","artist":"Mogin","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"5ac9ef2e-09b4-47a1-94a8-67373fc916b4","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"990f7ef9-dfe1-4d7e-93cb-b426b0b5beb5","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-07-09","images":[]},{"id":"933104d7-925c-420d-aa57-7730152cb2a4","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"861bc10f-3b80-45df-bf64-01c5732866f0","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"05895d3e-85e6-4b46-b0bf-f12afb4bb044","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"id":"18171f14-d3cf-473b-beb5-792feaf044f4","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"id":"6532fad6-f225-4366-bbe8-fc4353933697","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"6db7a6fd-1a00-4d71-902c-e3a24a5917bd","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"id":"67c087c2-a4eb-4c21-beb7-bad47fc616ad","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"52120316-878c-4c81-8e78-af7c21774c4c","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"id":"c6cf6963-32c7-4f0e-99b3-c6b39b61d4c7","number":"56","titl